• 원문(EMGS — 2025 Annual Highlights): https://educationmalaysia.gov.my/getmedia/cfe3a2b7-549a-4ba9-b703-7f0e6f08cefa/EMGS-2025-ANNUAL-HIGHLIGHTS.pdf
• 원문(말레이시아 고등교육부 — 중앙아시아 포럼 성명(2026-09-26)): https://www.mohe.gov.my/hebahan/kenyataan-media/kenyataan-media-forum-pendidikan-tinggi-malaysia-asia-tengah-2026-perkukuh-kerjasama-universiti-dan-mobiliti-pelajar
